{"unit_id":"tag:08LM:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为一阶增厚（first order thickenings）的态射（morphism），如情形<REF_0001>中所示。令<MATH_0002>为一个<MATH_0003>模（module）。假设<MATH_0004>是增厚（thickenings）的严格（strict）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上平坦（flat）。若存在一对（pair）<MATH_0007>，由一个<MATH_0008>模（module）<MATH_0009>，在<MATH_0010>上平坦（flat），以及一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0011>组成，则这样的一对的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set）在<MATH_0012>下是主齐性（principal homogeneous）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"一对"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"增厚态射的对象。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"增厚之间的态射。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定与所求的模。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚","context":"平方零扩张。"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格","context":"前述严格条件。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"模的相对平坦性。"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"一对","context":"模与同构所组成的一对。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"限制后模的同构。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"这样的一对的同构类。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"同构类的集合。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性","context":"Ext 群作用的性质。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08LN:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为一阶增厚（first order thickenings）的态射（morphism），如情形<REF_0001>中所示。令<MATH_0002>为一个<MATH_0003>模（module）。假设<MATH_0004>是增厚（thickenings）的严格（strict）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上平坦（flat）。存在一个<MATH_0007>模（module）<MATH_0008>，在<MATH_0009>上平坦（flat），且满足<MATH_0010>，当且仅当：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0011>是同构（isomorphism），且\n<STRUCT_0003>类（class）<MATH_0012>，来自引理<REF_0002>，为零。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所给增厚。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"增厚之间的态射。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定与提升后的模。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚","context":"平方零增厚。"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格","context":"前述严格性。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"相对平坦性。"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"所展示的自然映射。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"自然映射的性质。"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"障碍类。"}],"notes":[]}
