{"unit_id":"tag:08VQ:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n考虑一个交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0001>，由带环空间（ringed spaces）组成，其中水平（horizontal）箭头（arrows）是一阶增厚（first order thickenings），如情形<REF_0001>中所示。置<MATH_0002>与<MATH_0003>。令<MATH_0004>为一个<MATH_0005>模（module）。假设：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0006>是增厚（thickenings）的严格（strict）态射（morphism），\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0007>是平坦（flat）的，且\n<STRUCT_0005><MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>上平坦（flat）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n注意，（1）<MATH_0010>（2）蕴含<MATH_0011>（将引理<REF_0002>应用于<MATH_0012>）。在这些假设下，前节的理论尤其好。我们在下面的引理中汇集已经得到的结果。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"所考虑的方形。"},{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"图的对象。"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平","context":"图中箭头的方向。"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头","context":"图中的态射。"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"平方零增厚。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"所给的模。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚","context":"条件中的增厚。"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格","context":"前述严格性。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"增厚态射。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"态射与模的平坦性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08VR:statement","translation":"在上述情形中。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>存在一个<MATH_0001>模（module）<MATH_0002>，在<MATH_0003>上平坦（flat），且满足<MATH_0004>，当且仅当类（class）<MATH_0005>，来自引理<REF_0001>，为零。\n<STRUCT_0003>若这样的模（module）存在，则提升（lifts）的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set）在<MATH_0006>下是主齐性（principal homogeneous）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>给定一个提升（lift）<MATH_0007>，<MATH_0008>的自同构（automorphisms）的集合（set），其拉回（pull back）为<MATH_0009>，典范同构（canonically isomorphic）于<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"lifts","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"automorphisms","target_term":"自同构"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"pull back","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"提升后的模。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"相对平坦性。"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"障碍类。"},{"source_term":"lifts","target_term":"提升","context":"模的提升。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"提升的同构类。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"同构类或自同构的集合。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性","context":"Ext 群作用。"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升","context":"选定的提升模。"},{"source_term":"automorphisms","target_term":"自同构","context":"该模的自同构。"},{"source_term":"pull back","target_term":"拉回","context":"自同构限制到底空间。"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范同构","context":"自同构集合的自然同构。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08VS:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）。考虑交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0002>，其中（a）顶行是<MATH_0003>的一阶增厚（first order thickenings）的短正合列（short exact sequence），（b）底行是<MATH_0004>的一阶增厚（first order thickenings）的短正合列（short exact sequence），（c）每个<MATH_0005>限制（restricts）为<MATH_0006>，（d）每一对（pair）<MATH_0007>都是增厚（thickenings）的严格（strict）态射（morphism），且（e）每个<MATH_0008>都平坦（flat）。最后，令<MATH_0009>为一个<MATH_0010>模（module），在<MATH_0011>上平坦（flat），并置<MATH_0012>。令<MATH_0013>为典范（canonical）分裂（splitting）（注记<REF_0001>）。\n","allowed_english":["a","b","c","d","e"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"restricts","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"一对"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射","context":"所给的态射。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"所考虑的图。"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"两行中的对象。"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列","context":"增厚的正合列。"},{"source_term":"restricts","target_term":"限制","context":"态射的限制。"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"一对","context":"两个相容态射组成的一对。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚","context":"平方零扩张。"},{"source_term":"strict